  "details": "Template:\n\nVRChat Version: 1275\n\nDescription of the bug:\n\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?):\n\nI am crashing every 15-20 minutes no matter what world I am in. \n\nI join worlds with my friends, we hop sometimes from place to place. Most of the time we are in worlds with 10 or more people at parties.\n\nEssentially, I turn my head and see a visual glitch that drags the room around and then my computer freezes and black screens. This has been going on for three weeks and is beginning to wear on my patience. \n\nI have tried replacing my C to C cables, reinstalling drivers, and reinstalling Vrchat.\n\nI use the Quest 2 running an RX 590 Radeon graphics card and 8 Core CPU.",
